sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Workflow author
  participant UI as Trusted form renderer
  participant S as Syntara form resolver
  participant B as Credential Broker
  participant D as Declarative interpreter
  participant P as Provider Sandbox
  participant G as Provider gateway
  participant X as AAP or GitHub API
  participant E as Temporal and runtime EP

  U->>UI: Drag an installed step onto the canvas
  UI->>S: Load pinned schema, UI, and provider bindings
  S-->>UI: Inert form definition

  opt Connection is missing or expired
    U->>UI: Connect or reconnect
    UI->>B: Start approved authorization flow
    B->>X: Authorize user
    X-->>B: Callback with authorization code
    B->>B: Encrypt tokens and pin endpoint revision
    B-->>UI: Opaque connection reference
  end

  U->>UI: Focus, search, or change a dependency
  UI->>S: Revision, field path, connection, declared dependencies, query, cursor
  S->>S: Authorize and resolve pinned provider mode, endpoint, and grant
  alt Declarative provider
    S->>D: Bounded operation and filtered dependencies
    D->>G: Relative read request
  else Sandboxed provider
    S->>P: Exact provider digest, operation, filtered inputs, scoped capability
    P->>G: Relative read request using scoped capability
  end
  G->>B: Resolve approved short-lived authentication
  B-->>G: Attach authentication without exposing root secret
  G->>X: Bounded read-only request to approved endpoint
  X-->>G: Resource data or remote field metadata
  alt Declarative provider
    G-->>D: Bounded upstream response
    D-->>S: Normalized options or schema fragment
  else Sandboxed provider
    G-->>P: Bounded upstream response
    P-->>S: Provider ABI options or schema fragment
  end
  S->>S: Validate, normalize, bound, and cache result
  S-->>UI: Stable values, labels, source version, cursor
  UI-->>U: Render or update dependent fields

  U->>UI: Save draft
  Note over UI,S: Draft stores stable IDs, cached labels, and source version, never tokens
  U->>S: Publish workflow
  S->>S: Re-run the same pinned provider mode to revalidate references and schema
  S-->>U: Immutable workflow revision pinned

  Note over U,E: Temporal and runtime EP are not called while editing or revalidating the form
  U->>S: Start the published workflow
  S->>E: Generic Container activity with runtime credential handle
